L95: Materials and methods
L96: Experimental design
L97: The full experimental protocol for this trial was logged with a clinical trials register (ISRCTN27312291) and was published in advance (Alghannam et al.  2014 ). The primary outcomes were cardiovascular ( \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
L98: 				\usepackage{amsmath}
