L280: 				\begin{document}$$\dot{V}{\text{O}}_{2\max }$$\end{document} V ˙ O 2 max  between treatments). A priori sample size estimation (G*power version 3.1.7, University Düsseldorf, Düsseldorf, Germany) was performed using previous cycling-based post-exercise nutrition and endurance training data (Ferguson-Stegall et al.  2011 ) and revealed that a total of 24 participants were required to achieve 80% power to detect a worthwhile increase in endurance capacity (i.e.  \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
