L553: 				\begin{document}$$\dot{V}{\text{O}}_{2\max }$$\end{document} V ˙ O 2 max , given its positive correlation with changes in lean body mass, at least in cycling (Knuiman et al.  2019 ). Although we did not see an accentuated improvement in  \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
